# Tests for the package's module.

squareTest is test
squareTest purpose "Three squared is nine"
squareTest verifies square sideTimesSide
squareTest typeParameter none
squareTest input none
squareTest output none
squareTest outputOwnedBy none
squareTest raises none
squareTest effect none
squareTest uses none
squareTest memoryHeap false
squareTest async false
squareTest maxRecursion none
squareTest label begin loopKind none
squareTest label begin within none
squareTest let three Int64 3 immutable
squareTest let nine Int64 9 immutable
squareTest at begin do run
squareTest at begin do expect
squareTest at begin return ok none

run is call
run in squareTest
run invokes square
run argument side Int64 three copy
run result result Int64
run ownedBy none
run cleanedBy none
run borrows none
run catch none
run suppresses none

expect is call
expect in squareTest
expect invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expect argument expected Int64 nine copy
expect argument actual Int64 result copy
expect result none
expect ownedBy none
expect cleanedBy none
expect borrows none
expect catch none
expect suppresses none
